<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate rise to 6.72 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate rise to 6.72 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate for the Jordanian dinar rose to 6.72 percent on Monday from 6.18 percent on Sunday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said seven banks traded on the market in 20 reported transactions with a total value of 19.72 million dinars ($27.8 million).</p>
<p>$1=0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
